0 exciting levels + 14 levels with mini-games;<br>3 different difficulties to really test your skill;<br>Built-in strategy guide;<br>Original soundtracks for download;<br>Wallpapers;<br>Separate access to clips amd character descriptions;<br>Collectible puzzle pieces;<br>Beautifully crafted and diverse environments.<br><br>How to play:<br>\u25cf\tClick on obstacles to remove them.<br>\u25cf\tClick on resources to gather them.<br>\u25cf\tRepair buildings to produce additional resources.<br>\u25cf\tComplete the tasks listed at the top of the screen.",
